{"id":"vod_sn_37810","vodId":"37810","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"猫愿三角恋","name_cn":"猫愿三角恋","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b500dbce4f353e363549e8106928634d.jpg"},"summary":"在一次偶然中，拥有着对猫过敏的体质的普通少年高坂润平（浅沼晋太郎 配音）无意得罪了供奉在路边的猫地藏，从此，润平将彻底告别“平凡”二字。猫地藏显灵了，作为惩罚，润平必须实现一百只猫咪的愿望，否则，他本人将变成他最讨厌的猫咪。从此之后，各色可爱的猫咪开始出现在了润平的身边。胖胖的老大喵姆萨斯（田中敦子 配音），单纯可爱的小玉（福山润 配音），天然呆的熊猫（神原由衣 配音），高雅傲娇的黑猫奈尔（福井裕佳梨 配音），通过和它们的接触，润平逐渐摆脱了对于猫咪的偏见。　　在校园中，润平有一个一直暗恋着的女神——水野枫（井口裕香 配音），为了撮合润平和枫，被润平帮助过的猫咪们开始施展起了各自的本事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1cMHN8vey81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ewr0Gz3qQ51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EL9hFr5w3G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x4PY4EqWbj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YaJsc8vKKb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/40q7QmCmjX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LrVZKg0xSw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4VdMFKFXKH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bM7HnQ5iX21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gdBd21YAkf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZRgR5kdN0Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vzP1PC8UMh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.339Z"}